documentation_complete: true

title: 'AIDE Checks the Audit Tools of the CIS Benchmark'

description: |-
    Whether AIDE entries for the six audit tools that the CIS Benchmark
    names (auditctl, auditd, ausearch, aureport, autrace and augenrules)
    suffice, in the AIDE configuration file or in a file of its drop-in
    directory.

type: boolean

operator: equals

interactive: false

options:
    default: false
    false: false
    true: true
